@host = https://localhost:7129
# Paste an access_token from register/login here.
@token = <access_token>
@refreshToken = <refresh_token>
@requestId = <friend_request_id>

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "displayName": "Alice"
}

### Login (JSON)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "alice",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### OAuth 2.0 token endpoint - password grant
POST {{host}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=alice&password=Passw0rd!

### OAuth 2.0 token endpoint - refresh token grant
POST {{host}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configured OIDC providers
GET {{host}}/api/auth/providers

### Logout (revoke one refresh token; send {} to revoke all)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Send friend request
POST {{host}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "bob" }

### Incoming pending requests (use direction=outgoing for sent ones)
GET {{host}}/api/friends/requests?direction=incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accept
POST {{host}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Decline
POST {{host}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (sender)
POST {{host}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Friends
GET {{host}}/api/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
